description:
Deferred minors from the GitHub repo containers work (PR #126):
(1) a rolled-up visit never advances a container row's latest_at (index.rs roll_up), a trap for future consumers;
(2) a repos-only setup (no linked PR/issue rule) shows the latest sub-page title instead of owner/repo; a language-level container marker would fix it (documented limit in docs/adapters/github.repo.md);
(3) adapter-diff rarely generates scoped all-capture templates or within_self/within_bad_type;
(4) no tests for starterRuleUpdate's modes back-fill, 16-rule cap or compile guard, since no history entry exercises them yet; add them when a mode-bearing starter gets a STARTER_HISTORY entry;
(5) the four peer fix commits merged into #126 (d8c4f9a..b422a19) never got this session's codex exec review, which hung on a Codex model refresh.
